    "body": "## Scope\nImplements **Chat05B only** on `main@00ce2baca8dca177dfadffcb8bccbae11bca118f`.\n\n- Persists server-created social vote deadlines and explicit quorum/duration policy.\n- Enforces the human ballot boundary in the D1 write trigger using a Worker-authored timestamp taken immediately before SQL dispatch: `trusted_now_ms < deadline_at_ms`. Exact SQL commit-time cutoff has **not** been independently established.\n- Preserves Chat05A vote and human ballot tables. Adds a constrained deadline sidecar plus separately-originated deterministic NPC fixture ballots.\n- Closes with one D1 `batch()` for NPC fill and terminal sidecar state; retries/restarts read the durable result.\n- Includes request-path recovery when the scheduler was missed.\n\n## Evidence on exact HEAD\n**Current HEAD:** `ec58d792dc69d909afb5dc2749aca5a041538304`.\n**Base:** `main@00ce2baca8dca177dfadffcb8bccbae11bca118f`.\n**Current state:** OPEN / DRAFT / NOT MERGED.\n\n- GitHub check-runs: **8/8 completed / success**, verified 2026-10-31. Includes `private-api-local`, `wrangler-local-d1`, `sqlite-cas`, forensics `capture`.\n- Implementation report: Python SQLite migration/security suite 12/12 PASS; full local Wrangler/workerd/D1 private API run PASS. Cases include migration of populated database, D-1/D/D+1 and delayed pre-write lookup, 0/1/4/6/7 human votes for **test** quorum 7, concurrent close, rollback/retry, replay, restart, and scheduler recovery.\n- **Quorum 7 and duration 60 seconds are test-only parameters**, not approved game balance.\n- Exactly four changed paths: `gameplay-server/src/worker.js`, `gameplay-server/migrations/0011_chat05b_vote_deadlines_and_fill.sql`, `gameplay-server/test/private_api_local_test.mjs`, `gameplay-server/test/test_chat05a_vote_registry_sql.py`.\n\n## OPEN REVIEW GATES - DO NOT MERGE YET\n1. **Authoritative closed state:** `gameplay_social_vote_deadlines.status` can be `closed` while immutable Chat05A `gameplay_social_votes.status` remains `open`. Prove/document write eligibility, replay/read handling, and exact Chat05C integration contract, with regression checks. Do not weaken Chat05A immutability.\n2. **D1 INSERT delay cutoff:** `cast_at_ms` is sampled in Worker just before D1 submission, not at SQL commit time. Add a test that specifically delays **after timestamp capture but before D1 INSERT execution**, and either implement an evidenced D1-safe strict database-time cutoff or explicitly adopt and document the trusted-Worker-sampling linearization semantics and its limitations. Do not silently claim a strict commit-time cutoff.\n3. **Independent `critical_reviewer`:** prior Codex report states PASS, but no independently retrievable exact-HEAD critical-review artifact has yet been attached; the coordinator's GitHub review is `COMMENTED`, not that independent critical review. Capture verifiable exact-HEAD evidence, run again after any code changes.\n4. Reverify CI and exact branch HEAD after any correction. Do not mark ready for merge until gates are resolved.\n\nExisting review: https://github.com/samuray-games/AsyncScene/pull/461#pullrequestreview-5720459605\n\n## Safety/ownership\nCodex is the single implementation owner of this existing branch. No new PR, no merge, no Cloudflare deploy, no remote D1 migration, no Chat05C/Chat06 implementation, no unrelated shared-file edits. Chat03, Chat05C and Chat06 shared `worker.js` work remains serialized. This Draft does not claim hosted/runtime/Safari or production acceptance.",
